    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game transports players into a mysterious and colorful strange space, where they play as a ghost using the AWDS keys to navigate through the space in search of hidden sprites. The game's visuals adopt a unique artistic style, with each scene filled with fantastical elements that catch the eye. The background music is primarily percussive, creating a tense yet mystical atmosphere that enhances the game's immersive quality. The goal is to find all the sprites within a limited time frame, with each discovery accompanied by special sound effects that provide immediate feedback and encouragement to the player. The game not only tests the player's observational skills but also requires some strategic thinking, with efficient searching and avoiding getting lost being key to winning. It is a feast for both the eyes and ears, suitable for those who enjoy adventure and puzzle-solving.</p>",
